# Frame: little-endian u32 body length followed by the exact V1 CBOR map:
# {"code": "BAD_REQUEST", "message": "bad request"}.
# This value is intentionally checked in as hex so review can inspect the
# otherwise non-UTF-8 CBOR map marker without regenerating it from production
# serializers.
